{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 153165, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 102675, "uid": 110211, "type": 4, "title": "提升游戏流畅度小技巧", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1648825251, "updated_at": 1660458349, "updated_uid": 110211, "comment_at": 1681797851, "last_at": 1690486700, "comment_count": 14, "status": 1, "summary": "因为DC自动化做得基本都挺完善，挂机时间占比也不少，长期玩基本不会选择手机一直挂着，玩久了发热卡顿之类的问题也影响体验感和手机寿命。一、修改游戏设置（主界面右上角）游戏设定（选项卡1）：音量条3个都拖", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/480820.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/293863.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/690755.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 23, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 53499, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 18, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 153165, "content": "<div></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">因为DC自动化做得基本都挺完善，挂机时间占比也不少，长期玩基本不会选择手机一直挂着，玩久了发热卡顿之类的问题也影响体验感和手机寿命。</span></div></span><div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">一、修改游戏设置（主界面右上角）</span></span></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></span></div><div><div><ul data-level=\"0\" class=\"ul-list-style\"><li><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\">游戏设定（选项卡1）：音量条3个都拖到没声音</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\">性能设置（选项卡2）：</span></span></span>关闭Live2D，开启低配置选项、战斗中隐藏 buff/debuff图标、攻击效果、战斗中插图、剪切场景</li><li><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">其他设置（选项卡4）：SD/HD资源交换，更改为低分辨率</span></span></span></span></li></ul></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\">图示：</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/808440.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/808440.png\" style=\"\" data-width=\"404\" data-height=\"287\">&nbsp;<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/480820.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/480820.png\" style=\"\" data-width=\"400\" data-height=\"464\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/593002.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/593002.png\" style=\"height: 297.778px; width: 311.175px;\" data-width=\"395\" data-height=\"378\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">→</span></span>&nbsp;<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/909301.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/909301.png\" style=\"height: 210px; width: 299.662px;\" data-width=\"508\" data-height=\"356\"></div><br></div>\n                               </div></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">二、删除角色模型</span></span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><ul data-level=\"0\" class=\"ul-list-style\"><li><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">路径：Android/data/com.NextFloor.DestinyChild/files/asset/</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">character</span></span></span></span></li></ul>改名，下次大更前名字改回来</span></div><div><ul data-level=\"0\" class=\"ul-list-style\"><li><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">路径：Android/data/com.NextFloor.DestinyChild/files/</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">character</span></span></li></ul></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">改名/删除，对游戏没有影响</span></div></div></div><div><br></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><div><div>有一部分手机在Android文件夹前面是<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">storage/emulated/0</span></span>，点进0之后就是楼上的路径了<div><span style=\"\">正确路径下的com.NextFloor.DestinyChild文件夹里，可以看到2个文件夹：cache、files</span></div><div><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><span style=\"\">不影响汉化，打开游戏时加载条会变慢一点</span><br></span></div></div></div></span><div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\">优化后效果：</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp;<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/293863.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/293863.png\" style=\"height: 417.306px; width: 378.385px;\" data-width=\"720\" data-height=\"794\">&nbsp;<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/690755.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/690755.png\" style=\"height: 418px; width: 235px;\" data-width=\"720\" data-height=\"1280\"></div></div>\n                               </div></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">三、删除特效、DS动画等<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">（不建议）</span></span></div></div><br></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\">路径：Android/data/com.NextFloor.DestinyChild/files</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">/</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">effect/</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">battle</span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">二选一即可：</span><br style=\"\"></span><ul data-level=\"0\" class=\"ul-list-style\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><li><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"\">effect</span>改名，下次大更前名字改回来</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">battle删除其他文件，</span>留下这2个文件夹：index、buff （避免<span style=\"\">程序崩溃</span>）</span></span></span></span></li></ul></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"\">原来有特效的地方，会出现各色方块，比如夜世界明显观感不好，不太想影响游戏体验的话，这个操作也可以不做</span></span></span></span></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\">优化后效果：</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/729170.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/729170.png\" style=\"height: 336.969px; width: 189.542px;\" data-width=\"720\" data-height=\"1280\">&nbsp;<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/281398.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/281398.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; height: 334.619px; width: 188.208px;\" data-width=\"720\" data-height=\"1280\">&nbsp;<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/407356.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/407356.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; height: 333.069px; width: 187.333px;\" data-width=\"720\" data-height=\"1280\"></div></div>\n                               </div></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">四、重启游戏</span></span></div></div><br style=\"\">游戏本身存在优化问题，玩久了<span style=\"\">觉得卡就重启，包治百病</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">任何平台挂机，务必设置定时每小时重启游戏</span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><br><br><br><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line5\"></div><br style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">Tips:</span></span><br style=\"\"></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div>手机只需设置隐藏BUFF、3个静音和关闭那些战斗特效，基本不影响平常体验<br style=\"\">长期挂机的云手机/模拟器之类，这个大全套搞下来，亲测模拟器速度勉强比手机慢一点<br style=\"\">电脑模拟器挂机，推荐一下<span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">向日葵远程控制</span>来辅助，免费且手机电脑都可以随时看情况</div><div></div></span><div><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><br></span></div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/480820.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/293863.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/110211/2022/3/3/690755.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 110